flowchart TD
  U["User request (trusted)"] --> P["Plan built from<br/>the request only"]
  W["Web page, email, tool output<br/>(untrusted)"] --> D["Read as data,<br/>labelled untrusted"]
  P --> A["Actions: tools and arguments"]
  D -->|"may fill the answer"| O["Answer to the user"]
  D -.->|"blocked: cannot add actions"| A
  A --> Q{{"Argument from an<br/>untrusted source?"}}
  Q -->|"yes"| C["Ask the user to confirm"]
  Q -->|"no"| R["Run"]
